{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Why_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Why Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tiles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09e8e8646c9d6b54459ef7914ce0191d8a9e8aaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I, II, III$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/9/77937bd511ef606638c7ac4dc32e42f09545d8e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$IV$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> are translated so one tile coincides with each of the rectangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299ddf7c0f03ea46bf09f81f93adeea0756aa15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. In the final arrangement, the two numbers on any side common to two adjacent tiles must be the same. Which of the tiles is translated to Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e7f71699fece62a1150cc80613baf59935980df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(400); defaultpen(linewidth(0.8)); path p=origin--(8,0)--(8,6)--(0,6)--cycle; draw(p^^shift(8.5,0)*p^^shift(8.5,10)*p^^shift(0,10)*p); draw(shift(20,2)*p^^shift(28,2)*p^^shift(20,8)*p^^shift(28,8)*p); label(&quot;8&quot;, (4,6+10), S); label(&quot;6&quot;, (4+8.5,6+10), S); label(&quot;7&quot;, (4,6), S); label(&quot;2&quot;, (4+8.5,6), S); label(&quot;I&quot;, (4,6+10), N); label(&quot;II&quot;, (4+8.5,6+10), N); label(&quot;III&quot;, (4,6), N); label(&quot;IV&quot;, (4+8.5,6), N); label(&quot;3&quot;, (0,3+10), E); label(&quot;4&quot;, (0+8.5,3+10), E); label(&quot;1&quot;, (0,3), E); label(&quot;9&quot;, (0+8.5,3), E); label(&quot;7&quot;, (4,10), N); label(&quot;2&quot;, (4+8.5,10), N); label(&quot;0&quot;, (4,0), N); label(&quot;6&quot;, (4+8.5,0), N); label(&quot;9&quot;, (8,3+10), W); label(&quot;3&quot;, (8+8.5,3+10), W); label(&quot;5&quot;, (8,3), W); label(&quot;1&quot;, (8+8.5,3), W); label(&quot;A&quot;, (24,10), N); label(&quot;B&quot;, (32,10), N); label(&quot;C&quot;, (24,4), N); label(&quot;D&quot;, (32,4), N);[/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"322\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abfa9730b87de89c25ef163402f39ba9cbed3c33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ I \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ II \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ III \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ IV \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"20\" /> cannot be determined\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first notice that tile III has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on the bottom and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on the right side. Since no other tile has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Tile III must be in rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Tile III also has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on the left, so Tile IV must be in Rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC8_2007_11S.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/1/19/AMC8_2007_11S.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"284\" height=\"282\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=66MVYKyetGc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=66MVYKyetGc</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Why_Math\">Video Solution by Why Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Why Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WobCYII7TRg\">https://youtu.be/WobCYII7TRg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=omFpSGMWhFc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 